{34000}{}{You sit back and reflect on your past actions, your childhood, the ways Karma have affected you.  You were told that the only way to get rid of your Karma is to fulfll it.  But what about your self awareness, moments like these..}
{34010}{}{If I would become to be less like this... [Remove Traits]}
